   "note": "Main strategy as of 18 Nov 2026: the old (original) rules with the 18 Nov hold-backs, 2 A+ trades a day strict, XAUUSD spot for gold. Hold-backs were chosen on Apr-Nov 2026 trades, so that window is in-sample for this version; its independent evaluation starts at this freeze.",
   "rules": {
    "timeframes": "Swing: weekly location, 1D structure, 1H confirmation, 15m entry (long only). Intraday stocks and Nifty options: 15m bias, 5m structure and trigger. Positional: weekly structure, daily trigger. Gold (XAUUSD spot): the same engines; intraday, swing and positional, long and short.",
    "entry": "Daily (or 5m) CHoCH then BOS with displacement; zone = order block + FVG (+ fib 0.618-0.705); pullback into the zone; confirmation = rejection and a close back over the 9 EMA on relative volume >= 1.5x (swing: same hour on earlier days); swing entry = 15m CHoCH + BOS + FVG in the zone, retest, 15m close over the 9 EMA on 1.5x; no chasing.",
    "stop": "Below the order block / zone / pullback low minus 0.25 ATR (mirrored for shorts). Never widened.",
    "targets": "Swing: T1 1R (half, no early breakeven), T2 2R (a quarter, stop to entry), T3 3R, trail below each new daily higher low; expiry 28 days (positional 120). Intraday/options: T1 = prior leg extreme or 1R, then 2R and 3R; stop to entry at T1; square-off 15:15 IST (gold 02:00 IST).",
    "filters": "Score 0-10 (A+ 8-10 only taken); at most 2 new trades a day (India shared, gold separate), strict; hold-backs in holdbacks.py and swing.CFG; no options after 15:00 or on expiry afternoons, stop after 2 losses; no stock intraday from 14:00; stale data = no trade.",
    "risk": "0.5% a trade (A+ 0.75%), open risk cap 2%, day stop 0.75%, week 2%, month half size 3% and stop 5% (journal Settings / repo variables)."
   },
